  )
  (text "Arduino pins: D0/D1 serial (USB), D2 flow, D4 button, D5-D7 LEDs, D8 valve,\nD11 data to the ESP, D12 data from the ESP, D13 LED, A0-A3 remote.\nSame pins as the Nano boards, so WaterValveController.ino runs unchanged.\nBurn the bootloader once through J10 (ICSP) as \"Arduino Uno\", then upload over USB." (at 127 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6039ded2-1ffc-535f-85ff-7b989de9e85b)
  )
  (text "Off-board wiring: J1 12 V supply; J2 illuminated rocker switch (1 power, 2 load,\n3 lamp GND); J3 valve (+ to 1, - to 2) and YF-G1 sensor (black 2, red 3, yellow 4);\nJ5 button; J6-J8 plain panel LEDs; J4 ESP32-C3 (GPIO20 RX, GPIO21 TX)." (at 127 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a59943fa-03c0-5237-83dd-6f9e9af95de2)
  )

